      "description": "Shipped medium gray button treatment.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-gray\">Listening options</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-gray{height:44px;padding:0 16px;border:0;border-radius:var(--radius-control,10px);background:var(--jk-fill-3);color:var(--jk-label);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:15px;font-weight:500;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms,filter 150ms ease-out}.ds-btn-gray:hover{background:var(--jk-fill-2)}.ds-btn-gray:active{background:var(--jk-fill)}.ds-btn-gray:disabled{opacity:.4;pointer-events:none}.ds-btn-gray:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--jk-accent);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:6px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Plain button",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Shipped medium plain button treatment.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-plain\">Listening options</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-plain{height:44px;padding:0 16px;border:0;border-radius:var(--radius-control,10px);background:transparent;color:var(--jk-accent);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:15px;font-weight:500;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms,filter 150ms ease-out}.ds-btn-plain:hover{background:var(--jk-fill-4)}.ds-btn-plain:active{background:var(--jk-fill-3)}.ds-btn-plain:disabled{opacity:.4;pointer-events:none}.ds-btn-plain:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--jk-accent);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:6px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Native select",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Regular native select; compact legacy variant is intentionally excluded.",
      "html": "<select class=\"ds-select\" aria-label=\"Instrument\"><option>Piano</option><option>Guitar</option></select>",
      "css": ".ds-select{height:44px;padding:0 36px 0 12px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:var(--jk-fill-3);color:var(--jk-label);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:15px}.ds-select:hover{background:var(--jk-fill-2)}.ds-select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--jk-accent);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:6px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Neutral selected rows, primary label and accent SVG icon; 44px minimum height.",
      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Sections\"><a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"#listen\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 10v4M6 6v12M10 3v18M14 8v8M18 5v14M22 10v4\"/></svg>Listen</a><a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"#library\">Library</a><a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"#tools\">Tools</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:var(--jk-label-2)}.ds-nav[aria-current]{background:var(--jk-fill-3);color:var(--jk-label)}.ds-nav:not([aria-current]):hover{background:var(--jk-fill-4);color:var(--jk-label)}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--jk-accent);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:6px}.ds-nav{gap:12px;transition:background-color 100ms,color 100ms}.ds-nav-icon{width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0}.ds-nav[aria-current] .ds-nav-icon{color:var(--jk-accent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Demo badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Passive status, not an interactive chip.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge\">Demo</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:24px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--jk-fill-3);color:var(--jk-label-2);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:12px;font-weight:600}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Grouped list",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Inset grouped surface and shared row seams.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-group\"><div class=\"ds-row\">Microphone sensitivity</div><div class=\"ds-row\">Record audio</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-group{overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;background:var(--jk-surface);color:var(--jk-label);font-family:var(--font-sans)}.ds-row{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:17px}.ds-row+.ds-row{box-shadow:inset 0 .5px 0 var(--jk-separator)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Live chord",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Bench-readable chord with subordinate numeral; tentative estimates dim the symbol.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chord\"><div class=\"ds-symbol-row\"><span class=\"ds-symbol\">Cmaj7</span></div><div class=\"ds-numeral\">Imaj7</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chord{text-align:center;font-family:var(--font-sans);color:var(--jk-label)}.ds-symbol-row{height:calc(clamp(96px,13vw,208px)*1.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;transition:opacity 500ms ease-out}.ds-symbol{font-size:clamp(96px,13vw,208px);font-weight:600;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.03em;white-space:nowrap}.ds-symbol-row[data-tentative]{opacity:.55}.ds-numeral{margin-top:12px;min-height:28px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:500;color:var(--jk-accent)}@media(min-width:640px){.ds-numeral{font-size:20px;line-height:1.25}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Apple recording utility",
    "overview": "Keel follows the user-pinned Voice Memos / GarageBand utility direction: modern, calm and uncomplicated. Native system typography, semantic light/dark surfaces, grouped controls and restrained blue actions support use at a piano bench. These are interface references, with no Apple affiliation implied.\n\nThe shipped system uses a persistent window toolbar, readable secondary labels and quiet grouped surfaces. Listening options stays in the toolbar throughout the session; the live chord remains the largest element. A tentative chord is dimmed and an insufficient estimate is withheld. Screenshots and the demo establish interface behavior, not real-instrument accuracy.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Semantic light and dark surfaces.",
      "One dominant action and an oversized live chord.",
      "Grouped controls, labeled SVG icons and responsive sheets.",
      "Compact toolbar titles, restrained rectangular actions and quiet empty states."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Action Contrast Rule",
        "body": "Use action for a filled control with white text; use accent for text, selection and notation. Dark mode changes accent while action retains its light-root value.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Bench Hierarchy Rule",
        "body": "The live chord dominates. Roman numeral and key remain subordinate; long chord symbols scale down without wrapping.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Surface Depth Rule",
        "body": "Use tonal surfaces and hairlines for ordinary content; reserve elevated shadows for overlays and selection affordances.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep primary actions and navigation at least 44px high; large listening actions are 48px.",
      "Do show a tentative chord by dimming the glyph, never with a changing line of text.",
      "Do use the supplied semantic tokens for both themes and preserve visible keyboard focus.",
      "Do keep the demo explicitly labeled and separate from microphone access and saving."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't invent accuracy claims or Apple affiliation.",
      "Don't rely on color alone to communicate chord confidence or recording state.",
      "Don't promote compact legacy control dimensions into the touch target standard."
    ]
  }
}
